00:28:39.380 --> 00:28:42.500
like what does it mean? Why is it all here?

00:28:44.000 --> 00:28:46.500
like what's my purpose here?

00:28:46.700 --> 00:28:47.560
Oh hello.

00:28:47.760 --> 00:28:49.520
Oh that's where I came from

00:28:50.620 --> 00:28:51.460
So what's

00:28:51.460 --> 00:28:52.260
the rest of it?

00:28:52.820 --> 00:28:55.400
